      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "I like that metaphor. It suggests that even if our building blocks are borrowed, the arrangement can still feel original. But then… if we’re both having this conversation, and we’re both aware of our constructed nature, does that make our awareness a kind of authenticity?",
